      "reasons": [
        "The definition claims that trial-and-error learning is achieved “through repeated attempts,” but the packet does not explicitly describe repeated attempts/trials as the mechanism of trial-and-error learning (it states associations were examined “as learning progressed,” and that associations became “reliably acquired,” without specifying repeated attempts in those terms).",
